  "title": "Cranberry Glop",
  "description": "My family fights over this great Thanksgiving side dish that was first brought to our table by my Aunt Joan more than ten years ago. It&#39;s the only thing I&#39;ve found that will convert even the most die-hard canned cranberry eater to a fresh berry advocate.",
